---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Boing Network"
  description="Boing is an independent Layer 1 where quality is enforced by the protocol, with transparent deployment checks and open participation for users, developers and validators. Public testnet; mainnet not live."
  canonical="/"
>
  <!-- Hero: one composition — brand, headline, support, CTAs, dominant mark -->
  <section class="hero" id="hero">
    <div class="hero-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero-glow"></div>
      <div class="hero-grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <img src="/logo.svg" alt="" class="hero-logo-img" width="168" height="168" decoding="async" />
      <p class="hero-brand font-display">Boing Network</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title font-display">Quality, enforced by the protocol.</h1>
      <p class="tagline">An independent Layer 1 with transparent deployment checks and open participation for users, developers, and validators.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a href="/testnet" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the testnet</a>
        <a href="/developers/quickstart" class="btn btn-secondary">Build on Boing</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-stage">Public testnet — mainnet not live</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quality Gate -->
  <section class="section" id="problem">
    <h2 class="reveal">A quality gate before the ledger</h2>
    <p class="section-lead reveal delay-1">Boing screens deployments against transparent rules before they reach the chain. Clear cases are decided by the protocol; edge cases go to a community pool. Outcomes stay visible — the gate reduces risk, it does not replace your own review. <a href="/pdfs/QUALITY-ASSURANCE-NETWORK.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">QA design (PDF)</a></p>
    <ol class="gate-flow reveal delay-2">
      <li><span class="gate-num">1</span><div><strong>Submit</strong> bytecode with a declared purpose</div></li>
      <li><span class="gate-num">2</span><div><strong>Automate</strong> checks on size, opcodes, and rules</div></li>
      <li><span class="gate-num">3</span><div><strong>Decide</strong> clear accept or reject in protocol</div></li>
      <li><span class="gate-num">4</span><div><strong>Review</strong> edge cases in the community pool</div></li>
      <li><span class="gate-num">5</span><div><strong>Observe</strong> outcomes in <a href="https://boing.observer/qa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Boing Observer</a></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- Stack -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="principles">
    <h2 class="reveal">Built from first principles</h2>
    <p class="section-lead reveal delay-1">An independent chain with its own stack — not a fork or an EVM-compatibility layer.</p>
    <dl class="spec-row reveal delay-2">
      <div><dt>Rust</dt><dd>Protocol &amp; node</dd></div>
      <div><dt>HotStuff PoS</dt><dd>Consensus</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Ed25519</dt><dd>Signatures</dd></div>
      <div><dt>BLAKE3</dt><dd>Hashing</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Purpose-built VM</dt><dd>Not EVM-compatible</dd></div>
      <div><dt>~2 s blocks</dt><dd>When txs are pending</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <!-- Roles -->
  <section class="section" id="roles">
    <h2 class="reveal">Choose your role</h2>
    <p class="section-lead reveal delay-1">Everything below runs on the public testnet.</p>
    <div class="roles-grid">
      <a href="/testnet/users" class="role-link reveal delay-2">
        <h3>Use the network</h3>
        <p>Wallet, faucet, send, and explore on-chain activity.</p>
        <span class="role-cta">Start as a user</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/developers/quickstart" class="role-link reveal delay-3">
        <h3>Build an application</h3>
        <p>JSON-RPC, SDK, native accounts, and deployment QA.</p>
        <span class="role-cta">Developer quickstart</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/testnet/join" class="role-link reveal delay-4">
        <h3>Run a node</h3>
        <p>Join the open validator and operator path.</p>
        <span class="role-cta">Operator setup</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Roadmap -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="roadmap">
    <h2 class="reveal">Honest roadmap</h2>
    <p class="section-lead reveal delay-1">What exists on testnet, what is in progress, and what mainnet still requires.</p>
    <div class="road-grid">
      <div class="road-col reveal delay-2">
        <h3 class="road-live">Live on testnet</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Public RPC and faucet</li>
          <li>Quality Gate with published rules</li>
          <li>Express wallet &amp; Observer explorer</li>
          <li>Node, CLI, and SDK tooling</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="road-col reveal delay-3">
        <h3 class="road-dev">In development</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Community review pool</li>
          <li>Validator growth &amp; hardening</li>
          <li>Finance liquidity routes</li>
          <li>Incentivized testnet (not running)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="road-col reveal delay-4">
        <h3 class="road-req">Before mainnet</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Independent security audits</li>
          <li>Genesis &amp; launch-partner readiness</li>
          <li>Finalized slashing &amp; incident response</li>
          <li>Mainnet still not live</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Ecosystem -->
  <section class="section" id="ecosystem">
    <h2 class="reveal">The Boing ecosystem</h2>
    <p class="section-lead reveal delay-1">Four products, one network. Three steps onto the public testnet.</p>
    <ol class="first-steps reveal delay-2" aria-label="First steps on the Boing testnet">
      <li><a href="https://boing.express" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>1. Get a wallet</strong><span>Boing Express — web or Chrome</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/faucet"><strong>2. Get testnet BOING</strong><span>Free fees from the faucet</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="https://boing.observer" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>3. Send and verify</strong><span>Confirm in Boing Observer</span></a></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="apps-row">
      <a href="/docs/getting-started" class="app-link reveal delay-3">
        <h3>Boing Network</h3>
        <p>Protocol, docs, faucet, Quality Gate</p>
      </a>
      <a href="https://boing.express" class="app-link reveal delay-3" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <h3>Boing Express</h3>
        <p>Non-custodial wallet for Boing</p>
      </a>
      <a href="https://boing.observer" class="app-link reveal delay-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <h3>Boing Observer</h3>
        <p>Explorer with QA transparency</p>
      </a>
      <a href="https://boing.finance" class="app-link reveal delay-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <h3>Boing Finance</h3>
        <p>Native DEX swaps, pools, NFTs</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Tokenomics -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="tokenomics">
    <h2 class="reveal">Tokenomics</h2>
    <p class="section-lead reveal delay-1"><strong>1 billion BOING</strong> at genesis, then <strong>uncapped</strong> ongoing emissions. <strong>18 decimals</strong>. Genesis pie below is <strong>Proposed</strong>, not final. <a href="/pdfs/BOING-TOKENOMICS-AND-INCENTIVIZED-TESTNET.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plain-language PDF</a></p>
    <div class="stats-row reveal delay-2">
      <div><span class="stat-value">Uncapped</span><span class="stat-label">After genesis</span></div>
      <div><span class="stat-value">1B</span><span class="stat-label">Genesis supply</span></div>
      <div><span class="stat-value">18</span><span class="stat-label">Decimals</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tokenomics-block reveal delay-3">
      <h3>Initial supply allocation <span class="chart-badge">Proposed</span></h3>
      <p class="chart-intro">How the <strong>1B genesis</strong> would split at mainnet. Exact buckets remain <strong>Undecided</strong>.</p>
      <div class="chart-wrapper chart-supply">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="supply-pie-svg" role="img" aria-label="Proposed genesis allocation: Staking 50 percent, Treasury 20 percent, Community 15 percent, Team 15 percent">
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" class="stroke-teal" stroke-width="40" stroke-dasharray="125.7 125.7" stroke-dashoffset="0" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)" stroke-linecap="butt" />
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" class="stroke-gold" stroke-width="40" stroke-dasharray="50.3 201.0" stroke-dashoffset="-125.7" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)" stroke-linecap="butt" />
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" class="stroke-success" stroke-width="40" stroke-dasharray="37.7 213.6" stroke-dashoffset="-176.0" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)" stroke-linecap="butt" />
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" class="stroke-soft" stroke-width="40" stroke-dasharray="37.7 213.6" stroke-dashoffset="-213.7" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)" stroke-linecap="butt" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <ul class="legend">
        <li><span class="dot dot-teal"></span> Staking 50%</li>
        <li><span class="dot dot-gold"></span> Treasury 20%</li>
        <li><span class="dot dot-success"></span> Community 15%</li>
        <li><span class="dot dot-soft"></span> Team 15%</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="chart-note"><strong>Locked:</strong> 1B at genesis, uncapped after, 18 decimals. Vesting and sub-pots remain Undecided. No TGE date.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="charts-row">
      <div class="tokenomics-block reveal delay-4">
        <h3>Fee allocation <span class="chart-badge">Proposed</span></h3>
        <div class="chart-wrapper chart-doughnut">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="doughnut-svg">
            <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" class="stroke-teal" stroke-width="20" stroke-dasharray="201 50.3" stroke-dashoffset="0" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)" />
            <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" class="stroke-gold" stroke-width="20" stroke-dasharray="50.3 201" stroke-dashoffset="-201" transform="rotate(-90 50 50)" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <ul class="legend">
          <li><span class="dot dot-teal"></span> Validators 80%</li>
          <li><span class="dot dot-gold"></span> Treasury 20%</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="tokenomics-block reveal delay-5">
        <h3>Emission schedule <span class="chart-badge">Proposed</span></h3>
        <div class="chart-wrapper chart-line">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 120" class="line-svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="emissionGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--boing-accent)" stop-opacity="0.3" />
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--boing-accent)" stop-opacity="0" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <polyline points="0,24 33,48 67,66 100,79 133,90 200,108 200,120 0,120" fill="url(#emissionGrad)" stroke="none" />
            <polyline points="0,24 33,48 67,66 100,79 133,90 200,108" fill="none" class="stroke-teal" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="chart-note">~8% Y1 of the 1B base, decay ≈ 0.85, floor 1%. No TGE date.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tokenomics-faq reveal delay-6">
      <h3>Why uncapped max supply?</h3>
      <p><strong>Uncapped ≠ free print.</strong> Genesis is fixed at <strong>1 billion BOING</strong>. After that, supply grows only through a documented declining emission schedule. Hard caps can starve long-run security when base fees stay intentionally low; an open decaying schedule keeps the inflation path honest and predictable.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Build CTA -->
  <section class="section section-close" id="build">
    <h2 class="reveal">Build on Boing</h2>
    <p class="section-lead reveal delay-1">Native accounts, adaptive gas, and transparent deployment checks — on a public testnet today.</p>
    <div class="cta reveal delay-2">
      <a href="/testnet/join" class="btn btn-primary">Join the testnet</a>
      <a href="/docs/getting-started" class="btn btn-secondary">Get started</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust / listings — end-of-page strip, not a hero overlay -->
  <aside class="trust-strip" aria-label="Listings">
    <a
      href="https://chainquiry.com/projects/boing-network/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      aria-label="View this profile on Chainquiry"
      style="display:inline-block;max-width:100%;line-height:0;"
    >
      <picture>
        <source
          media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)"
          srcset="https://chainquiry.com/?cqbh_badge=1&amp;v=1.2.1-378482bb&amp;theme=dark&amp;size=standard&amp;motion=still"
        />
        <img
          decoding="async"
          src="https://chainquiry.com/?cqbh_badge=1&amp;v=1.2.1-378482bb&amp;theme=dark&amp;size=standard&amp;motion=subtle"
          alt="Listed on Chainquiry"
          width="288"
          height="72"
          style="display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;"
        />
      </picture>
    </a>
  </aside>
</Layout>

<script>
  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  if (!reduce) {
    const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        for (const entry of entries) {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            io.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        }
      },
      { rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px', threshold: 0.12 }
    );
    nodes.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));
  } else {
    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((el) => el.classList.add('is-visible'));
  }
</script>

<style>
  /* ——— Hero: one composition, brand-first, atmospheric navy/cyan ——— */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: min(92vh, 920px);
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 55% at 50% 18%, rgba(var(--boing-accent-rgb), 0.22), transparent 58%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 80% 80%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12), transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #050A1A 0%, #0A1128 55%, #050A1A 100%);
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero { padding: 3rem 1rem 2.5rem; min-height: 80vh; }
  }

  .hero-atmosphere {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    width: min(70vw, 520px);
    height: min(70vw, 520px);
    left: 50%;
    top: 18%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(var(--boing-accent-rgb), 0.28), transparent 68%);
    animation: hero-glow-pulse 7s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .hero-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(var(--boing-accent-rgb), 0.07) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(var(--boing-accent-rgb), 0.07) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 56px 56px;
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 38%, #000 12%, transparent 70%);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 38%, #000 12%, transparent 70%);
    animation: hero-grid-drift 28s linear infinite;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-logo-img {
    display: block;
    width: clamp(112px, 22vw, 168px);
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 28px rgba(var(--boing-accent-rgb), 0.55));
    animation: hero-mark-in 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both, hero-mark-float 8s ease-in-out 1s infinite;
  }
  .hero-brand {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 5.5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--boing-text);
    text-shadow: 0 0 36px rgba(var(--boing-accent-rgb), 0.4);
    animation: hero-copy-in 0.85s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.12s both;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.8vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    color: var(--boing-accent-soft);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-shadow: none;
    animation: hero-copy-in 0.85s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.22s both;
  }
  .tagline {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    animation: hero-copy-in 0.85s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.32s both;
  }
  .hero-stage {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--boing-warning);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    animation: hero-copy-in 0.85s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.48s both;
  }

  .cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    animation: hero-copy-in 0.85s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.4s both;
  }
  .btn {
    padding: 0.8rem 1.45rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--boing-accent);
    color: var(--boing-accent-ink);
    border: none;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--boing-accent-soft);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--boing-line);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--boing-accent);
    color: var(--boing-accent-soft);
  }

  /* ——— Sections ——— */
  .section {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 4.25rem 2rem;
    max-width: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .section { padding: 3rem 1.25rem; } }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .section { padding: 2.5rem 1rem; } }
  .section > * {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .section-alt {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(16, 26, 56, 0.35), transparent);
  }
  .section-close {
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  /* Discreet end-of-page listing badge (Chainquiry) */
  .trust-strip {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(59, 140, 255, 0.08);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(16, 26, 56, 0.25));
  }
  .trust-strip a {
    opacity: 0.92;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease-out;
  }
  .trust-strip a:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .trust-strip { padding: 1rem 1rem 2.75rem; }
  }
  .section h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .section-lead {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .section-lead a { color: var(--boing-accent-soft); }

  /* Quality Gate flow — no card boxes */
  .gate-flow {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 560px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .gate-flow li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--boing-line);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .gate-flow li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .gate-flow strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700; }
  .gate-flow a { color: var(--boing-accent-soft); }
  .gate-num {
    flex: none;
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--boing-accent-ink);
    background: var(--boing-accent);
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  /* Specs — open row, no cards */
  .spec-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .spec-row div { margin: 0; }
  .spec-row dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--boing-accent-soft);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
  }
  .spec-row dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  /* Roles — interactive link surfaces only */
  .roles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .role-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 1.35rem 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--boing-accent);
    background: transparent;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .role-link:hover {
    background: rgba(var(--boing-accent-rgb), 0.06);
    border-color: var(--boing-accent-soft);
  }
  .role-link h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .role-link p {
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .role-cta {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--boing-accent-soft);
  }

  /* Roadmap — open columns */
  .road-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem 1.75rem;
  }
  .road-col h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .road-live { color: var(--boing-success); }
  .road-dev { color: var(--boing-accent-soft); }
